  CORE -- "reads, checksums" --> DATA
  CORE -- "chat; /api/ps for memory;<br/>embeddings planned (E3)" --> OLL
  CORE -. "E6 only" .-> HOST
  CORE -. "PDF export" .-> LO
  CORE -- "evaluation only" --> ORIG

